<header class="page-header">
<div>
<p class="eyebrow">MONITORING / ACTIVITY</p>
<h1>시스템 로그</h1>
<p class="page-description">수집부터 발송까지, 모든 활동을 실시간으로 살펴보세요.</p>
</div>
<span class="live-label" data-stream-status>
<span class="tiny-dot gray">
</span>연결 중</span>
</header>
<section data-page="logs">
<div class="panel log-panel">
<div class="log-toolbar">
<div class="tab-buttons" role="group" aria-label="로그 종류">
<button data-log-type="delivery" class="active" aria-pressed="true">전송</button>
<button data-log-type="fetch" aria-pressed="false">수집</button>
<button data-log-type="translation" aria-pressed="false">번역</button>
</div>
<div class="actions">
<button data-log-filter="error" class="secondary small" aria-pressed="false">{{> icon name="alert"}}오류만 보기</button>
<button data-log-pause class="secondary small" aria-pressed="false">일시정지</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="log-column-header">
<span>시각 (KST)</span>
<span>종류</span>
<span>활동 내역</span>
</div>
<div id="log-stream" data-sse="/api/logs/stream" class="log-list" role="log" aria-live="off">
<div class="empty-inline">로그를 불러오는 중…</div>
</div>
<div class="log-footer">
<button id="load-more-logs" class="secondary">이전 로그 더 보기</button>
<span class="muted">운영 로그는 30일간 보관됩니다.</span>
</div>
</div>
</section>
